  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> strong transmutation; <strong>CL</strong> 15th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> chest; <strong>Price</strong> 2,000 gp (+1), 8,000 gp (+2), 18,000 gp (+3), 32,000 gp (+4), 50,000 gp (+5), 72,000 gp (+6); <strong>Weight</strong> 4 lbs</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThis ornate vest is littered with elemental runes across the front of it, the back portraying a myriad of symbols relating to each element. When worn by a creature who possesses the elemental overflow class feature, they gain a deflection bonus to their Armor Class equal to the bonus to attack rolls they gain from that class feature while it is active. This bonus is limited by the strength of the vest.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Wondrous Item, creator must be a kineticist of a level at least three times the bonus of the vest; <strong>Cost</strong> 1,000 gp (+1), 4,000 gp (+2), 9,000 gp (+3), 16,000 gp (+4), 25,000 gp (+5), 36,000 gp (+6)</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-magical-items#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
